    <iconUrl>http://www.uipath.com/favicon.ico</iconUrl>
    <description>UiPath SAP BAPI Automation Activities</description>
    <releaseNotes>New Features and Improvements

SAP BAPI v2.0.0 brings a total rehaul of the activities from the previous version. The SAP BAPI wizard as well as the two previous activities, Open SAP Connection and Close SAP Connection, have been deprecated. 
They have now made way for the SAP Application Scope and Invoke SAP BAPI activities, which follow the classic model of centering around a scope activity, which handles the connection to an app.

For the full release notes, please visit https://activities.uipath.com/docs/release-notes-sap-bapi.</releaseNotes>
